<SizedBox height="10"/>
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#334155">L1–L3 允许并行（如 N02/N03、N04/N05、N06/N07）。最长先决路径 11 节点：N01→N02→N04→N07→N08→N09→N10→N11→N12→N13→N14。</Text>
<Spacer/>
<Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Container padding="(4,9)" color="#0D948812" borderRadius="6"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="16" color="#0D9488" fontStyle="BOLD">11 节点最长路径</Text></Container><SizedBox width="8"/><Container padding="(4,9)" color="#0D948812" borderRadius="6"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="16" color="#0D9488" fontStyle="BOLD">3 组并行</Text></Container><SizedBox width="8"/><Container padding="(4,9)" color="#0D948812" borderRadius="6"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="16" color="#0D9488" fontStyle="BOLD">L0 → L10</Text></Container></Row>
</Column></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="936"><Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="18" color="#64748B">读图：横向层 = 先决顺序；同层堆叠 = 并行；粉色虚线 = 反馈；灰色交点若没有端点圆点，不构成依赖。</Text></Row></Positioned>
